    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Silking date - Estimation</rdfs:label>
    <ns1:definition xml:lang="en">Observe plants carefully and record date when 50% of plants within a plot area have silks visible (female flowering date). This is determined on a daily basis by counting the number of plants with at least one silk extruded divided by the total number of plants in the plot.</ns1:definition>
